<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92106" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾱΐζω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥηΐζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾶ, ῥᾴων</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>grow
				easier, more endurable</i>, of ailments, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				2.3.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.56
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of
			persons, <i>find relief from pain, recover from illness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				5
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				462d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				1.13
			</span></i>; <i>take one's rest</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.5.68
			</span></i> (as v.l.): sts. c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. πόνων</span>
			<i>rest</i> from toil, <i><span class="en">
				Memn.
				4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. ἐκ νόσου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ach.Tat.
					4.16
				</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾴδιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>make easier, alleviate</i> an illness, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				5.25
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαΐσαι τρισυλλάβως Ἀττικοὶ
				τὸ ἐκ νόσου ἀναλαβεῖν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; 3sg.
			aor.
			subj.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαείσηι</span> (sic) <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				263.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαΐσηι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHamb.</u>
					27.8
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.]</div>
